{"The 'next' action permits offset to become exactly user_count, producing an empty result set": 0.758428156375885, "The public group members template iterates 'members', but the route only sets 'controller.model' to the group and never exposes a 'members' property, so the table can render empty even after findMembers() populates model.members": 0.6836305260658264, "Group creation from the client sends alias_level, but Admin::GroupsController#create never assigns it, so newly created groups cannot persist the selected alias level": 0.9133038520812988, "group.users.delete(user_id) performs a raw SQL DELETE on the group_users join table, bypassing ActiveRecord callbacks, so the counter_cache 'user_count' on GroupUser is never decremented when a member is removed": 0.7441161274909973, "The add_members action directly calls group.add(user) without checking if user is already a member, causing a database unique constraint violation when adding duplicate members": 0.4272734820842743}